cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "geo-crawl-audit"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency audit tool that tests whether AI crawlers (GPTBot, ClaudeBot,
  PerplexityBot, OAI-SearchBot) can reach, fetch fast enough, and read a website. Audits
  crawler input rather than answer-engine output: multi-user-agent probing, WAF
  differential detection, raw-HTML readability classification, and access-log parsing
  with bot IP verification.
